35
00:29:18,020 --> 00:29:32,840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At a time when public confidence in government spending is being tested, COA must be equipped to detect wrongdoing early, verify that projects exist, and work as intended.

36
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:46,360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And hold accountable those who misuse public money. We also want to recognize the men and women of COA who carry out this difficult mandate every day. Their work is often difficult, technical, and done away from public attention.

37
00:29:47,400 --> 00:30:00,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Audit observations and notices of disallowance are not always well received, but are part of the checks and balances that protect public funds. Government agencies should see them not as an attack, but as

